644.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-06T14:13:04Z"},"body":"Introduces SwapchainCreateFlags enum to control swapchain creation (NORMAL, STATIC, PROTECTED) in OpenXR composition layers.\r\nThis allows the user to set  SwapChainCreate Flags to either have one static image on the composition layer or set the protected content flag which allows stuff like Widevine DRM protected videos to be displayed on the composition layer\r\n\r\n\r\nAs this is the first time **ever** creating something with c++, i am open for feedback, will try my best to answer to your guys' feedback and improve the code. \r\n\r\nA question I have already: Should I rename the values in the enum, as \"normal\", \"static\" and \"protected\" are not that informative and \"normal\" is just not normal. it just sets a 0 as bit\r\n\r\nThanks ^^","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108644/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issu